repository-code: "https://github.com/ICONgroupCWC/jetbot_world"

abstract: >
  This repository provides a URDF/XACRO model of the Waveshare
  JetBot ROS AI Kit for robotic simulation in ROS and Gazebo.
  It includes a CSI RGB camera, Intel RealSense depth camera,
  IMU, 2D LiDAR, and other onboard sensors to support realistic
  robot simulation and autonomous robotics research.

keywords:
  - JetBot
  - Waveshare
  - ROS
  - Gazebo
  - URDF
  - XACRO
  - Robotics
  - Simulation

